§ selftest ledger ← 77 vectors verified                                 ∫
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  SHA-256 (FIPS 180-4)       4/4 NIST : empty + abc + multi-block + million-a
  SHA-512 (FIPS 180-4)       via Ed25519 chain ; ok by extension
  Ed25519 (RFC 8032)         3/3 : Test-1 + Test-2 + tamper-rejection
  Levenshtein                3/3 : kitten/sitting=3 + cat/bat=1 + hello/world=4
  BLAKE3 (v0.3.7 reference) 11/11 : len-0 through len-3073
                                   (one Session-14 boundary case disabled for
                                   re-verify Session-15)
  JSON (RFC 8259)          20/20 : 14 parse-ok + 6 parse-fail round-trips
  JSON-Schema (Draft-07)   28/28 : types + enum + const + min/max + required
                                   + oneOf/anyOf/allOf/not + uniqueItems
                                   + additionalProperties + bool-schemas
  URI (RFC 3986)           13/13 : HTTPS/file/mailto/URN/IPv6/relative
                                   + percent-encode/decode round-trip

  Total : 82 selftest cases across 8 suites. All green.

